  "title": "Premalu Star Naslen\u2019s sports drama Alappuzha Gymkhana set for Telugu release",
  "publication_date": "2025-04-18T03:32:05+00:00",
  "summary": "Actor Naslen, known to Telugu audiences from Premalu, stars in the Malayalam sports drama Alappuzha Gymkhana, directed by Khalid Rahman. Originally released April 10, 2025, the film received positive reviews and is slated for a Telugu release on April 25, 2025, featuring an ensemble cast and music by Vishnu Vijay.",
  "content": "After gaining popularity among Telugu audiences with Premalu, actor Naslen is all set to return with another film \u2013 this time in a sports drama titled Alappuzha Gymkhana. Directed by Khalid Rahman, the Malayalam film is now gearing up for its Telugu release on April 25, 2025.\\n\\nAlappuzha Gymkhana was originally released in Malayalam on April 10, 2025, and received a positive response for its content-driven storytelling and refreshing take on the sports genre. The film has been holding steady at the box office and is now aiming to make a mark with Telugu audiences.\\n\\nAlongside Naslen, the film features a talented ensemble cast including Lukman Avaran, Ganapathi S. Poduval, Sandeep Pradeep, Anagha Ravi, Franco Francis, Baby Jean, and Shiva Hariharan. Produced by Plan B Motion Pictures and Reelistic Studios, the film\u2019s music is composed by Vishnu Vijay.",
