  "markdown_content": "## Overview\\n\\nAfter gaining popularity among Telugu audiences with Premalu, actor Naslen is all set to return with another film \u2013 this time in a sports drama titled Alappuzha Gymkhana. Directed by Khalid Rahman, the Malayalam film is now gearing up for its Telugu release on April 25, 2025.\\n\\n## Release and Reception\\n\\nAlappuzha Gymkhana was originally released in Malayalam on April 10, 2025, and received a positive response for its content-driven storytelling and refreshing take on the sports genre. The film has been holding steady at the box office and is now aiming to make a mark with Telugu audiences.\\n\\n## Cast and Production\\n\\n* Ensemble cast:\\n  - Naslen\\n  - Lukman Avaran\\n  - Ganapathi S. Poduval\\n  - Sandeep Pradeep\\n  - Anagha Ravi\\n  - Franco Francis\\n  - Baby Jean\\n  - Shiva Hariharan\\n\\n* Produced by Plan B Motion Pictures and Reelistic Studios\\n* Music composed by Vishnu Vijay",
